  "description": "Participants see twelve computer-rendered views of a planned schoolyard greening design in random order, each for at least 45 s, and rate each on Han's Short Version Revised Restoration Scale (SRRS: emotional, physiological, cognitive and behavioural items, 9-point scale). Scenes cross foliage (in-leaf green, in-leaf orange, leafless), two perspectives, and planting (deciduous only vs added evergreen conifers). Rebuilt from Paddle & Gilliland (2016), IJERPH 13(5): 497, with the paper's Figure 5 images and the item wording printed in its Figure 4 (CC BY 4.0). Scoring: reverse the two physiological items, average each subscale and the eight items; compare foliage conditions with paired tests and the leafless scenes with vs without evergreens.",
